{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">ISO-DATE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309899","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ISO-DATE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ISO-DATE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">ISO-DATE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a character representation of a DATE,\nDATETIME , or DATETIME-TZ that conforms to the ISO 8601 standard\nfor date/time representations.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__note_N1002E_N10024_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> These formats\nare equivalent to the XML Schema <code class=\"ph codeph\">date</code> and <code class=\"ph codeph\">dateTime</code> formats. </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__syntax_GC18S62695525\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d121614e105\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__idGDM2K02672043\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>ISO-DATE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>  ) </code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">An expression that evaluates to a DATE, DATETIME or DATETIME-TZ.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">The\nISO-DATE function returns the character string in the standard ISO\nformat of the data type. The following table lists the standard\nISO formats for each data type.</p>\n            <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049\"><caption><span class=\"table--title-label\">Table 1. </span><span class=\"title\">Standard\nISO formats</span></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:40%\" /><col style=\"width:60%\" /></colgroup><thead class=\"thead\">\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                    <th class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__1\">Data type</th>\n                    <th class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__2\">ISO format</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__1 \">DATE</td>\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__2 \">YYYY-MM-DD</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-1\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__1 \">DATETIME</td>\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__2 \">YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.SSS</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__1 \">DATETIME-TZ</td>\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\" headers=\"ISO-DATE-function__standard-iso-formats_GDM2K12672049__entry__2 \">YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS.SSS+HH:MM</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ISO-DATE-function__see-also_GC18S82695532\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d121614e210\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\">ADD-INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-function.html\">DATE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\">DATE-FORMAT attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-function.html\">DATETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-TZ-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-TZ-function.html\">DATETIME-TZ function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DAY-function.html\">DAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ETIME-function.html\">ETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INTERVAL-function.html\">INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MONTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MONTH-function.html\">MONTH function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MTIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MTIME-function.html\">MTIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOW-function.html\">NOW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIME-function.html\">TIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIMEZONE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIMEZONE-function.html\">TIMEZONE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TODAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TODAY-function.html\">TODAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"WEEKDAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/WEEKDAY-function.html\">WEEKDAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-function.html\">YEAR function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\">YEAR-OFFSET attribute</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\">IS-LEAD-BYTE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"KBLABEL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/KBLABEL-function.html\">KBLABEL function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309899","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"ISO-DATE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ISO-DATE-function.html","type":"Manual"}